  core/src/main/resources/io/github/pobsteta/surculus/core/reperes/wmm/WMM2025.COF
  core/src/test/resources/io/github/pobsteta/surculus/core/reperes/wmm/WMM2025_TestValues.txt

Origine : archive officielle NOAA NCEI
  https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/sites/default/files/2024-12/WMM2025COF.zip
  (page https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/world-magnetic-model), téléchargée le 2026-10-16.
  WMM2025.COF est identique au fichier WMM.COF de l'archive
  (sha256 dfa8597825af4e0b87ff4198a5b4fb661b3c49f4cd090cd0164e0259b075582f) ;
  WMM2025_TestValues.txt est recopié sans modification
  (sha256 e6975b093dddeb6153e0b23cc418425c438167e7c5b1dd795da379cb654f5819).

Citation : NOAA NCEI Geomagnetic Modeling Team; British Geological Survey. 2024:
  World Magnetic Model 2025. NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information.
  DOI 10.25921/aqfd-sd83.

